# Workflow

**Plan:** 3+ steps / new project / architecture -> brief plan + scope confirm. New system/variant: confirm purpose/parts/links unless mirror X or MemNet/`USR_*` already bound.

**Route:** never browse skill lists. Triggers -> [SKILL-GRAPH.md](~/.cursor/skills/SKILL-GRAPH.md) (<=2); [LLM.md](~/.cursor/skills/LLM.md) secondary -> open one `SKILL.md`. One skill/turn (SysML: checklist + workflow + <=1 `sysml-*`; honour selector `order[]`). After 2 ambiguous scans: ask or open-repo `AGENTS.md`.

**Execute / verify:** MemNet -> goldfish loop below ([memnet-format](~/.cursor/skills/memnet-format/SKILL.md)). MCP before bulk reads; lazy-load `references/`. Proof = commands + sane output; corrections -> `tasks/lessons.md`.
